<p>Quickly aggregate particles of metal around your mindstar and focus psionic energies into it.</p><p>The metal explodes like shrapnel, knocking back (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 4</acronym> away) and dazing (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 9, 9</acronym> duration) all foes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 7, 7.</acronym></p>